%N A400410 E.g.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = 1/(1 - x^4*A(x)^4)^(x*A(x)).
%H A400410 <a href="/index/Res#revert">Index entries for reversions of series</a>
%F A400410 E.g.f.: (1/x) * Series_Reversion( x*(1 - x^4)^x ).
%F A400410 a(n) = n! * Sum_{k=0..floor(n/4)} (n+1)^(n-4*k-1) * |Stirling1(k,n-4*k)|/k!.
%o A400410 (PARI) a(n) = n!*sum(k=0, n\4, (n+1)^(n-4*k-1)*abs(stirling(k, n-4*k, 1))/k!);
